What the support desk knows, kept next to the code that knows it. One desk, every product:
`sched-prod` (calendar invites for about 300k people) and the rest. When something breaks, the reports land here first.

Start with [triage](/kb/triage/dedupe) if you are new on the desk.

Read the [signed #4471 review](/kb/incidents/4471-review) before handling date reports.
Use [decision 0002](/kb/decisions/0002-dedupe-by-cause) and the updated triage guide;
the historical subject-only decision is no longer the active rule.

## Pages

<KbIndex />

## Writing a page

Keep the words here and the logic in `src/lib`. A number that can be computed should be
computed by a component, not typed into a paragraph.
